@OtelDemo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### Root Endpoint
GET {{OtelDemo_HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/plain

### Get All Products
GET {{OtelDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Get Product By ID (Success)
GET {{OtelDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Get Product By ID (Invalid ID - Bad Request)
GET {{OtelDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products/0
Accept: application/json

### Create Order (Success)
POST {{OtelDemo_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Create Order (Invalid Request - Bad Request)
POST {{OtelDemo_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 0,
  "quantity": 0
}

### Get Order By ID
GET {{OtelDemo_HostAddress}}/api/orders/e3b0c442-98fc-11ee-b9d1-0242ac120002
Accept: application/json

### Trigger Error (Simulates Exception)
GET {{OtelDemo_HostAddress}}/api/error
Accept: application/json

### Delayed Response (1 Second Delay)
GET {{OtelDemo_HostAddress}}/api/delay
Accept: application/json
